result/
*.log
.planning/

# Documentation artifacts
compact-*.md
context-*.md
CLAUDE.md
*.md
docker/
e2e*/
core/storage/.migration

# --- Integration test harness (test/integration + test/docker) ---
# The global rules above (*.json, *.txt, *.md, *.sh, docker/) silently exclude
# required harness source files. Un-ignore the harness trees below, but keep
# their runtime state (IPFS blocks, Postgres data, logs) ignored.
!test/integration/
!test/integration/**
!test/docker/
!test/docker/**
# Re-ignore runtime/generated state under the harness (must come AFTER the
# negations above so it wins).
test/docker/data/
# Native (no-Docker) harness runtime state: per-node data dirs, Postgres data,
# rendered configs, and the on-demand kubo download cache (test/native/.kubo).
test/native/
*.log

# Release notes consumed by GoReleaser (make release passes --release-notes when
# present). Must be track-able despite the global *.md ignore so it can be
# committed at the tagged commit; otherwise the release silently falls back to
# auto-generated notes.
!RELEASE_NOTES.md
